orgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>It was a thrilling and unexpe=
cted tribute.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;col=
or:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Last month, in the midst of a weeklong tour =
stop in Hong Kong, the Canadian pop star the Weeknd surprised concertgoers =
by debuting a video for his newest love song, =E2=80=9C</span><a href=3D"ht=
tps://nl.nytimes.com/f/a/XcCZKAHtM4A907iwnNB3xw~~/AAAAARA~/WxM-KBXg5Pwvnfex=
