ce screamed.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;colo=
r:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>In the weeks since, =E2=80=9CHong Kong=E2=80=
=9D has dominated the city=E2=80=99s music charts, and =E2=80=9CMonsoon=E2=
=80=9D has enjoyed increased streams on Spotify. Revelers belted the song i=
n neon-lit bars over Halloween weekend. Some fans posted video tributes to =
the films of Wong Kar-wai on social media, with the Weeknd=E2=80=99s new so=
ng as the soundtrack.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,s=
erif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>The song and the video have unleashe=
d a wave of nostalgia, excitement and longing in the city. The last few yea=
rs have seen sweeping political changes here. For many, the new controls ex=
erted by mainland China over freedom of expression have fundamentally alter=
ed Hong Kong=E2=80=99s soul.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px ge=
orgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>So =E2=80=9CHong Kong,=E2=80=
=9D for these residents, is bittersweet. Its 1990s nostalgia has reignited =
a dormant love for the city, a reminder of the promise they felt it once he=
ld. One YouTube commenter described the heartbreak of watching the video as=
 someone =E2=80=9Cwho already knows the ending.=E2=80=9D</span></p><p style=
=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>I=
n the verses sampled in the song, Wong sings in Cantonese of seasonal winds=
 about to blow everything away, =E2=80=9Cas if everything in the world is a=
bout to disappear.=E2=80=9D She notes, in the refrain, that it is useless t=
o go against predetermined plans, but that what remains is an empty expanse=
 and =E2=80=9Cheartache that won=E2=80=99t die.=E2=80=9D</span></p><p style=
=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>T=
he Weeknd=E2=80=99s video highlights the beauty and charm that remain in ev=
eryday Hong Kong life: a forest-green ferry crossing its cerulean harbor, a=
 woman roasting chestnuts in a giant wok and holding up a thumbs up in sati=
sfaction. It has also reminded residents that the Hong Kong they love is as=
 evocative as ever in song and cinema, and can be produced by artists as un=
expected as a Canadian pop star.</span></p><table border=3D"0" cellpadding=
